      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warren%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town grew in 1878 when a new railroad line ran through the area, linking it to regional markets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
