      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warren%2C_Indiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Warren sits along the Salamonie River, a tributary that helped shape the town’s early industry.",
